WEBVTT

01:35.280 --> 01:39.570
With Nancy's help, NINJA Slayer heads towards
the top of the tower to fight Laomoto,

01:39.570 --> 01:42.540
but first he must fight six battles with the SIX GATES.

01:43.040 --> 01:46.660
The NINJA in the first room was Devilfish-SAN.

01:46.660 --> 01:49.000
While he struggled with the mecha-arms,

01:49.000 --> 01:51.920
NINJA Slayer chopped off his head and killed him.

01:52.630 --> 01:54.880
What a difficult battle it was.

01:55.720 --> 02:01.550
The NINJA in the second room was Razor Edge,
whose body was covered in ceramic katanas.

02:01.930 --> 02:06.230
He destroyed the hidden ceramic katanas in his ears, crucified him on a pillar,

02:06.230 --> 02:07.350
and killed him.

02:08.390 --> 02:10.770
What a difficult battle it was.

02:11.520 --> 02:14.570
The NINJA in the third room was Waterboard-SAN.

02:15.190 --> 02:18.950
He turned the room into an aquarium,
and attacked underwater,

02:18.950 --> 02:22.280
but NINJA Slayer's superior NINJA LUNG CAPACITY won the day.

02:23.450 --> 02:25.750
What a difficult battle it was.

02:26.660 --> 02:30.460
With my help, NINJA Slayer-SAN escaped the room.

02:30.460 --> 02:32.750
But then there was some noise in the connection.

02:33.130 --> 02:35.920
Even so, he continued to the fourth room.

02:35.920 --> 02:39.300
The NINJA in the fourth room was Armadillo-SAN.

02:39.300 --> 02:44.390
His armadillo armor was tough, but NINJA Slayer broke his back and killed him.

02:45.060 --> 02:47.310
What a difficult battle it was.

02:47.810 --> 02:50.060
There was more noise on the line.

02:50.060 --> 02:52.360
I didn't know what was going on,

02:52.360 --> 02:56.030
but he hallucinated visions of all the NINJA he had ever killed.

02:56.030 --> 02:59.200
And, it seems, his family as well.

02:59.200 --> 03:03.530
But NINJA Slayer-SAN overcame it with his strong mind,

03:03.530 --> 03:05.700
and proceeded to the fifth room.

03:06.990 --> 03:09.210
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

03:09.910 --> 03:11.710
I am Hellkite.

03:11.710 --> 03:15.460
DŌMO, Hellkite-SAN. I am NINJA Slayer.

03:20.220 --> 03:21.220
YEEART!

03:21.220 --> 03:23.550
It's useless, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

03:23.550 --> 03:28.350
This room was created especially for me!

03:28.350 --> 03:33.350
The giant fans were being controlled remotely by Hellkite, using IRC!

03:33.350 --> 03:34.440
YEEART!

03:36.610 --> 03:38.230
You can't even touch me!

03:41.450 --> 03:43.700
GWAAAARRGGGHHH!

03:48.200 --> 03:52.210
Did you see that? That's the power of the TRUE SIX GATES!

03:53.210 --> 03:54.000
GWARGH!

03:54.000 --> 03:56.500
I can win! I can win this!

03:56.500 --> 03:57.880
YEEART!

04:00.340 --> 04:01.010
Impossible!

04:01.010 --> 04:02.220
YEEART!

04:01.380 --> 04:02.220
GWARGH!

04:04.720 --> 04:06.510
That won't work anymore!

04:06.510 --> 04:11.230
I'll wear you down, physically and mentally, from a place of absolute safety!

04:11.230 --> 04:12.390
YEEART!

04:17.230 --> 04:20.190
What's wrong, NINJA Slayer-SAN?

04:20.190 --> 04:22.570
Can't do anything without your SENSEI?

04:22.570 --> 04:23.530
YEEART!

04:23.530 --> 04:24.860
I told you it's useless!

04:25.450 --> 04:26.780
GWARGH!

04:26.780 --> 04:31.330
I shall KAISHAKU you,
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

04:31.870 --> 04:33.540
YEEART!

04:34.790 --> 04:35.790
I'm slowing down?

04:37.790 --> 04:40.300
Why are the fans moving on their own?

04:40.300 --> 04:41.630
YEEART!

04:43.760 --> 04:45.930
I'm almost there!

04:45.930 --> 04:48.550
Laomoto-SAN, BANZAI!

04:50.930 --> 04:54.350
You lose, Hellkite-SAN!
Read your HAIKU!

04:54.350 --> 04:55.600
YEEART!

04:54.690 --> 04:55.600
GWARGH!

04:56.310 --> 04:58.900
It's useless! As long as I'm in this room—

04:58.900 --> 04:59.480
WHAT?!

04:59.480 --> 05:02.110
GWAAAAAAAARRRGGGHH!

05:04.070 --> 05:08.660
Nancy had HACKED the Tokorozawa pillar's CYBERSPACE!

05:08.660 --> 05:09.580
Hacking?!

05:09.580 --> 05:09.910
YEEART!

05:09.910 --> 05:11.200
GWARGH!

05:25.880 --> 05:30.510
I must tell Laomoto-SAN!

05:38.480 --> 05:42.110
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

05:42.440 --> 05:44.440
I am Gatekeeper.

05:44.440 --> 05:46.650
DŌMO, Gatekeeper-SAN.

05:47.030 --> 05:48.740
I am NINJA Slayer.

05:49.320 --> 05:51.620
So you're the last one?

05:51.620 --> 05:53.450
NINJA must be slain!

05:54.250 --> 05:56.540
Truly unfortunate!

05:56.540 --> 06:00.670
I never expected to have to dirty my hands with this matter.

06:01.630 --> 06:06.550
I have been so terribly hurt each time you've killed one of the SIX GATES.

06:06.800 --> 06:09.260
You won't have to worry about that after today.

06:09.260 --> 06:11.390
Because I will send you to JIGOKU.

06:12.260 --> 06:14.810
I am so very, very sad.

06:14.810 --> 06:18.600
A foolish IRREGULAR like yourself has disrupted our organization,

06:14.810 --> 06:18.600
NOTE: An IRREGULAR is not REGULAR.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.810
and now I must handle this matter my—

06:20.810 --> 06:25.480
How long will you continue to prattle about your emotions, Gatekeeper-SAN?

06:26.360 --> 06:30.910
I am so upset that I must once again commit acts of violence—

06:30.910 --> 06:33.120
Your eyes are blind.

06:33.120 --> 06:36.500
They are the eyes of a man who only sees the world in numbers.

06:36.500 --> 06:42.750
The cold, hollow numbers you see contain the deaths of my wife, child, and SENSEI.

06:43.000 --> 06:46.090
You are my hated enemy,
and you will be slain!

06:46.340 --> 06:48.220
You're a madman.

06:49.050 --> 06:52.890
Miyamoto Masashi says that the dead have no MOUTHS.

06:52.890 --> 06:55.560
I shall fight you, as you wish.

06:56.140 --> 06:57.140
YEEART!

06:58.230 --> 06:59.190
Come!

06:59.190 --> 07:01.230
I shall judge your KARATE myself!

07:01.230 --> 07:03.400
YEEART!

07:06.230 --> 07:12.410
Splendid movements given your many injuries,
but how long will you last?

07:12.410 --> 07:13.450
YEEART!

07:14.870 --> 07:16.290
GWARGH!

07:23.830 --> 07:27.550
You're getting desperate.
And yet, I'm still uninjured.

07:27.550 --> 07:29.130
YEEART! YEEART! YEEART!

07:29.130 --> 07:30.340
HUHH! HAHH! HWAHH!

07:33.430 --> 07:36.100
My TONFA can block SURIKEN!

07:36.100 --> 07:37.430
YEEART!

07:37.430 --> 07:42.940
TATSUJIN! A microsecond's error in timing,
and the TONFA will collide!

07:37.430 --> 07:42.940
NOTE: This is a NINJA who STANDS UP.

07:42.940 --> 07:44.150
YEEART!

07:44.610 --> 07:46.020
GWARGH!

07:48.690 --> 07:49.780
It's useless.

07:49.780 --> 07:50.860
It is not useless!

07:50.860 --> 07:52.110
YEEART!

07:52.360 --> 07:54.950
GWAARRRGGGHH!

07:58.200 --> 08:01.910
The KARATE that brought you this far is a thing to behold.

08:01.910 --> 08:03.170
I'll grant you that.

08:07.630 --> 08:12.630
You plan to settle this with the next attack, yes? A good decision.

08:12.630 --> 08:13.380
YEEART!

08:15.590 --> 08:17.640
GWARRGGH!

08:17.640 --> 08:19.020
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

08:19.020 --> 08:21.270
He's falling straight into NARAKU!

08:21.270 --> 08:22.520
YEEART!

08:26.810 --> 08:28.650
GWARGH!

08:28.980 --> 08:31.490
GWAAAAAAARRRRRGGHHHHHHH!

08:31.940 --> 08:34.950
You lose! Read your HAIKU.

08:34.950 --> 08:35.950
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

08:35.950 --> 08:37.370
Splendid.

08:37.370 --> 08:40.700
But you have no chance of defeating Laomoto-SAN.

08:40.700 --> 08:42.790
You will DOGEZA and DIE.

08:42.790 --> 08:43.250
And—

08:43.250 --> 08:44.210
Read your HAIKU!

08:45.960 --> 08:48.920
Laomoto-SAN, BANZAI.

08:48.920 --> 08:51.340
INGAOHŌ!

08:51.710 --> 08:52.550
YEEART!

08:52.550 --> 08:55.800
SAYŌNARA!

09:06.650 --> 09:08.730
This is the third time.

09:09.070 --> 09:10.360
Come.

09:10.360 --> 09:12.490
I will not be defeated by illusions.

09:13.030 --> 09:14.700
Illusions?

09:15.530 --> 09:17.200
It's your fault.

09:19.660 --> 09:20.950
GWARGH!

09:21.740 --> 09:23.450
It's your fault, love.

09:24.210 --> 09:25.960
It's your fault, daddy.

09:26.580 --> 09:29.500
Indeed. It is your fault.

09:30.590 --> 09:32.000
Calm down.

09:34.010 --> 09:35.760
This is just an illusion.

09:36.430 --> 09:38.760
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

09:39.600 --> 09:42.310
It's your fault.

09:43.470 --> 09:46.640
What you're doing is useless.

09:46.640 --> 09:50.820
All you did was cost more people their lives.

09:50.820 --> 09:52.320
GWAAAARRGGHH!

09:52.820 --> 09:54.190
That's right, love.

09:54.190 --> 09:55.740
GWAAAAARRRGGGHHH!

09:56.360 --> 09:57.700
That's right, daddy.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.530
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

10:00.620 --> 10:01.870
Now...

10:01.870 --> 10:02.990
Who...

10:03.580 --> 10:05.160
...am I?

10:05.910 --> 10:07.370
You don't know.

10:07.370 --> 10:11.920
You can't see me.

10:11.920 --> 10:14.510
I angered the boss,

10:14.510 --> 10:17.010
and the coup d'etat plan was ruined.

10:17.010 --> 10:18.880
And because of that, I...

10:19.390 --> 10:20.470
I...

10:21.140 --> 10:22.600
Who am I?

10:27.060 --> 10:29.770
Do not go along with the enemy's schemes!

10:29.770 --> 10:32.520
FŪRIN KAZAN CHADŌ.

10:32.520 --> 10:33.770
And...

10:33.770 --> 10:35.360
FŪRIN KAZAN.

10:36.440 --> 10:38.650
Do you know how many you've—

10:38.650 --> 10:40.410
Silence, illusion!

10:40.660 --> 10:44.790
SENSEI gave me the INSTRUCTIONS and taught me!

10:44.790 --> 10:45.540
GWARGH...

10:45.540 --> 10:47.830
Now, I will follow them!

10:47.830 --> 10:50.330
GWAAAARRGGGGHH!

10:51.130 --> 10:52.710
It's your fault.

10:53.670 --> 10:55.170
Daddy...

11:04.600 --> 11:05.260
Daddy...

11:06.470 --> 11:07.600
Love...

11:10.390 --> 11:11.810
Fuyuko.

11:11.810 --> 11:12.860
Tochinoki.

11:14.270 --> 11:18.690
GWAAAAAAARRRRRRRGGGGGGGH!

11:22.910 --> 11:24.830
You have arrived.
